@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create an article
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "New wind farm opens in Denmark",
  "content": "Example article content.",
  "source": "Happy Headlines",
  "scope": "europe"
}

### List articles from one database shard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/articles/europe?limit=20
